  "items": [
    {
      "id": "item-gf-choice",
      "concept_ids": [
        "c-gf-mixer"
      ],
      "kind": "single_choice",
      "stem": "某下变频混频器的本振频率为 $f_{LO} = 10\\,\\mathrm{MHz}$，射频输入为 $f_{RF} = 7\\,\\mathrm{MHz}$，中频 $f_{IF}$ 是多少？",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "A",
          "text": "1 MHz"
        },
        {
          "label": "B",
          "text": "3 MHz"
        },
        {
          "label": "C",
          "text": "7 MHz"
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "text": "17 MHz"
        }
      ],
      "answer": {
        "choice_index": 1,
        "value": null,
        "tolerance": 0.0,
        "text": ""
      },
      "explanation": "下变频时中频等于两频率之差：$f_{IF} = f_{LO} - f_{RF} = 10 - 7 = 3\\,\\mathrm{MHz}$，所以选项 B（3 MHz）正确。",
      "self_check": "",
      "pitfalls": [],
      "assumptions": [],
      "study_table": "",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "source_ids": [
        "src-gf-ch4-1"
      ],
      "variant_of": null
    },
    {
      "id": "item-gf-numeric",
      "concept_ids": [
        "c-gf-gain"
      ],
      "kind": "numeric",
      "stem": "某混频器射频输入电压 $U_{RF} = 20\\,\\mathrm{mV}$，中频输出电压 $U_{IF} = 200\\,\\mathrm{mV}$，求变频增益 $G_c$（dB）。",
      "options": [],
      "answer": {
        "choice_index": null,
        "value": 20.0,
        "tolerance": 0.1,
        "text": ""
      },
      "explanation": "变频增益按电压比的分贝值定义：\n\n$$G_c = 20\\log_{10}\\frac{U_{IF}}{U_{RF}}$$\n\n代入 $U_{IF} = 200\\,\\mathrm{mV}$、$U_{RF} = 20\\,\\mathrm{mV}$，得 $G_c = 20\\log_{10}10 = 20\\,\\mathrm{dB}$。\n\n这里的关键是：电压比是 10 倍，对应 20 dB；若用功率比计算，同样的 10 倍功率才对应 10 dB。分母必须是射频输入电压，而不是本振电压，否则会得到一个与器件无关的数值。\n\n实际测量时输入输出端口都要匹配到 50 Ω，否则分压会直接叠加到测量结果里，使读数偏离器件本身的增益。",
      "self_check": "",
      "pitfalls": [],
      "assumptions": [],
      "study_table": "",
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "source_ids": [
        "src-gf-ch4-2"
